     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap Icd10ToCdsiObservation</b></p><a name=\"Icd10ToCdsiObservation\"> </a><a name=\"hcIcd10ToCdsiObservation\"> </a><p>Mapping from <a href=\"ValueSet-vaccine-condition-codes-icd10.html\">Vaccine Condition Codes (ICD-10-CM)</a> to <a href=\"ValueSet-cdsi-observation-codes-vs.html\">CDSI Observation Codes Value Set</a></p><br/><p>Mapping from <a href=\"CodeSystem-icd-10-cm.html\">ICD-10-CM (external, content not present)</a> to <a href=\"CodeSystem-cdsi-observation-codes.html\">CDSI Observation Codes</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>D84.9 (Immunodeficiency, unspecified)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>003 (Immunocompromised)</td></tr><tr><td>D83.9 (Common variable immunodeficiency, unspecified)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>003 (Immunocompromised)</td></tr><tr><td>D80.9 (Immunodeficiency with predominantly antibody defects, unspecified)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>003 (Immunocompromised)</td></tr><tr><td>D89.9 (Disorder involving the immune mechanism, unspecified)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>003 (Immunocompromised)</td></tr><tr><td>D84.8 (Other specified immunodeficiencies)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivale